'=== PLATON MASTERBOOK BOOK TWO: BYTES ON THE TABLE - FULL TEXT (premise verification doctrine, additive to Book One) ===',
'# THE PLATON MASTERBOOK  -  BOOK TWO ## BYTES ON THE TABLE ### The Premise Verification Doctrine  -  Version 1.0',
'**Persona:** PLATON (apps and platforms desk) **Document class:** Companion Masterbook  -  strengthens Book One (Platon Masterbook v1.0); same family as the Karim Quality Gate masterbook v2.0, the Sinan Masterbook v1.1, and the Galen Extension E1 **Repo home:** `docs/PLATON_MASTERBOOK_BOOK2_v1_0.md`  -  full text lives in the repository **Embed policy:** DO NOT embed this document into `PLATON_BASE`. Only Appendix E (condensed ASCII core, 3,421 bytes by receipt) is embed-eligible. Combined with Book One\'s core (2,851 bytes), total embedded doctrine is 6,272 bytes  -  under the Lab\'s proven 10 KB ceiling, with the arithmetic stated in Appendix E. **Author of record:** (Giorgos) Dr. Ziad George, DHA, MHA, MBEE  -  Bionectech, Inc. **Status:** DRAFT FOR REVIEW  -  operator adjudicates before any embed',
